OL,3,CWigan Warriors captain Liam Farrell to
OL,4,Cretire at the end of the season
OL,6,FWigan Warriors captain Liam Farrell is
OL,7,Fto retire from professional rugby
OL,8,Fleague at the end of the 2026 Betfred
OL,9,FSuper League season.
OL,11,FThe 36-year-old will bring the curtain
OL,12,Fdown on a 17-season career with the
OL,13,Fclub, having made 428 appearances and
OL,14,Fscored 151 tries.
OL,16,FFarrell came through Wigan's
OL,17,Fscholarship and academy system after
OL,18,Fstarting out with Wigan St Patrick's.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
