PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1789159783
OL,3,CWigan Warriors captain Liam Farrell to
OL,4,Cretire at the end of the season
OL,6,FHe made his first-team debut as a
OL,7,Fteenager in April 2010, featuring in a
OL,8,F54-4 win over Wakefield.
OL,10,FSince then, he has become one of the
OL,11,Fmost decorated players in the club's
OL,12,Fhistory, winning six Super League
OL,13,Ftitles, five Challenge Cups and two
OL,14,FWorld Club Challenges.
OL,16,FHe has also lifted five League
OL,17,FLeaders' Shields, won the Harry
OL,18,FSunderland Trophy and been named in
OL,19,Fthe Super League Dream Team five times.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
