PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1789159783
OL,3,CWigan Warriors captain Liam Farrell to
OL,4,Cretire at the end of the season
OL,6,FThe back-rower, who has been capped 12
OL,7,Ftimes by England, became Wigan captain
OL,8,Fin 2023.
OL,10,FOne of his most memorable moments came
OL,11,Fin 2011, when he scored a last-minute
OL,12,Fwinning try against fierce rivals St
OL,13,FHelens in the Good Friday derby.
OL,15,FFarrell said playing for Wigan had
OL,16,Falways been a childhood ambition.
OL,18,F"It's been a whirlwind of a career,
OL,19,Fmore than I could ever have dreamed of
OL,20,Fdoing," he said.
