PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1789159783
OL,3,CWigan Warriors captain Liam Farrell to
OL,4,Cretire at the end of the season
OL,6,F"Although I'll be sad not to be
OL,7,Fplaying anymore, I'm also very
OL,8,Fgrateful for the career that I have
OL,9,Fhad and I can now look forward to the
OL,10,Fnext part of my life."
OL,12,FHe added: "Playing one game for Wigan
OL,13,Fwas always the goal for me. If I had
OL,14,Fhave done that and never played again
OL,15,FI would have been immensely proud.
OL,17,F"So to have been able to play over 400
OL,18,Fgames in this jersey has been nothing
OL,19,Fshort of incredible.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@VO]tD@KOUyD@AOU
