PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1789159783
OL,3,CWigan Warriors captain Liam Farrell to
OL,4,Cretire at the end of the season
OL,6,F"I've loved it here. It's a very
OL,7,Fspecial place for me and my family,
OL,8,Fand it always will be."
OL,10,FFarrell will remain at Wigan beyond
OL,11,Fhis playing career, taking up a
OL,12,Fstrength and conditioning role after
OL,13,Fgaining qualifications alongside his
OL,14,Frugby career.
OL,16,FChief executive Kris Radlinski said
OL,17,FFarrell would go down as "one of
OL,18,FWigan's greatest players", praising
OL,19,Fhis commitment, resilience and
OL,20,Fleadership.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@WO]yD@ZOUzD@YO]
