PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1789159783
OL,3,CWigan Warriors captain Liam Farrell to
OL,4,Cretire at the end of the season
OL,6,FHead coach Matt Peet also paid tribute
OL,7,Fto Farrell's contribution, describing
OL,8,Fhim as exactly what Wigan supporters
OL,9,Fwant from "one of their own".
OL,11,FThe club says Farrell will now focus
OL,12,Fon enjoying the remainder of his final
OL,13,Fseason before beginning the next
OL,14,Fchapter of his career at the Warriors.
OL,26,@qD@KOUqD@\O]
